{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8d7dafdc6cfcaae1","type":"tool_result","content":"==> dashboard.md <==\n# Dashboard\n\n**Jira component**: Dashboard\n**Maturity**: Stable (GA)\n**Owning team**: RHOAI Dashboard\n**Upstream**: opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard\n**Midstream**: red-hat-data-services/odh-dashboard\n**Konflux onboarded**: yes\n\n## Role in the platform\n\nSingle-pane web console for RHOAI. Surfaces data science projects, workbenches,\nmodel serving, pipelines, and distributed workload status. User-facing enablement\nof any component requires a Dashboard integration (navigation section, resource\nlists, creation/edit forms, status views).\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- OpenShift OAuth for authentication and project-scoped RBAC\n- Component backends via Kubernetes CRs (InferenceService, Notebook, PipelineRun,\n  Workload) — the Dashboard reads and writes CRs, it owns no data plane\n\n## Interfaces\n\n- Kubernetes API only; no private component APIs\n- Per-component feature flags and defaults via the OdhDashboardConfig CR\n\n==> notebooks.md <==\n# Notebooks\n\n**Jira component**: Notebooks\n**Maturity**: Stable (GA)\n**Owning team**: Workbenches\n**Upstream**: kubeflow/notebooks (notebook-controller)\n**Midstream**: opendatahub-io/kubeflow (notebook-controller fork)\n**Konflux onboarded**: yes\n\n## Role in the platform\n\nWorkbench (notebook server) lifecycle: the notebook-controller reconciles\nNotebook CRs into StatefulSets with OAuth sidecars. Includes the idle culler,\nwhich stops workbenches after a configurable inactivity period; culling defaults\nand per-workbench overrides are administered through the Dashboard\n(OdhDashboardConfig notebookController settings).\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- Workbench images (imagestreams) maintained by the platform\n- Dashboard for spawn UI and culling configuration\n\n## Interfaces\n\n- Notebook CRD (kubeflow.org/v1)\n- Culling configured via notebook-controller-culler-config ConfigMap; last\n  activity tracked per kernel through Jupyter server API probes","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-941eb270de719964","agent_id":"a8ba2dbbcb872c890","session_id":"75f31b44-6829-4bc6-8c24-b6fae2a504e2","uuid":"6cb89da7-725a-4c8c-a276-a3d0212e0703","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:49:23.374Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8d7dafdc6cfcaae1","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9008"}
