{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-adf88e0876d6a5eb","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Notebooks\n2\t\n3\t**Jira component**: Notebooks\n4\t**Maturity**: Stable (GA)\n5\t**Owning team**: Workbenches\n6\t**Upstream**: kubeflow/notebooks (notebook-controller)\n7\t**Midstream**: opendatahub-io/kubeflow (notebook-controller fork)\n8\t**Konflux onboarded**: yes\n9\t\n10\t## Role in the platform\n11\t\n12\tWorkbench (notebook server) lifecycle: the notebook-controller reconciles\n13\tNotebook CRs into StatefulSets with OAuth sidecars. Includes the idle culler,\n14\twhich stops workbenches after a configurable inactivity period; culling defaults\n15\tand per-workbench overrides are administered through the Dashboard\n16\t(OdhDashboardConfig notebookController settings).\n17\t\n18\t## Dependencies\n19\t\n20\t- Workbench images (imagestreams) maintained by the platform\n21\t- Dashboard for spawn UI and culling configuration\n22\t\n23\t## Interfaces\n24\t\n25\t- Notebook CRD (kubeflow.org/v1)\n26\t- Culling configured via notebook-controller-culler-config ConfigMap; last\n27\t  activity tracked per kernel through Jupyter server API probes\n28\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a4fedbb549889118","agent_id":"a96fc96f9a143a395","session_id":"75f31b44-6829-4bc6-8c24-b6fae2a504e2","uuid":"124b9637-d277-4334-a86f-1c70bfa6b1bf","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:59:29.226Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-adf88e0876d6a5eb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9008 decomposition"}
