tcomes\n52\t  before publication.\n53\t- Publish the whitepaper.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- The whitepaper is published and covers enterprise usability best practices\n58\t  for admin configuration, onboarding, and enterprise tooling integration on\n59\t  RHOAI.\n60\t- Content is technically reviewed against the implemented platform behavior\n61\t  (admin configuration direction as delivered, measured onboarding\n62\t  improvements, delivered tooling integrations) — reviewed by someone with\n63\t  knowledge of the implementations, with review comments resolved.\n64\t- Guidance reflects the actually-selected admin configuration direction and\n65\t  the measured onboarding results, not the pre-decision contradictory\n66\t  feedback.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- HLR-4 (publish a whitepaper describing enterprise usability best practices\n71\t  on RHOAI) — this epic delivers the whitepaper.\n72\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-89d21299ae8b2e2c","agent_id":"a4c0607f6ac3f8f22","session_id":"75f31b44-6829-4bc6-8c24-b6fae2a504e2","uuid":"8e7e58a7-fcaa-4bfd-83f5-c3c9ff27803a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:06:17.654Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-82060055ebecc2b5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9008 decomposition"}
