{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b04d796c253da22e","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9008\n3\tepic_count: 6\n4\tcritical_path_length: 3\n5\tdecompose_complete: true\n6\ttriage: null\n7\ttriage_rationale: null\n8\trevised: true\n9\t---\n10\t# Decomposition Summary — RHAISTRAT-9008\n11\t\n12\tStrategy: \"Make RHOAI more usable for enterprise teams\" (status: Refinement\n13\tDone, priority: Normal).\n14\t\n15\t## Triage Outcome\n16\t\n17\tNeither Step 0 check fired:\n18\t\n19\t- **Not below threshold**: the strategy is not S-sized — it spans two\n20\t  components (Dashboard, Notebooks), two owning teams, and contains three\n21\t  genuine unknowns (the Open Questions table) whose answers change which epics\n22\t  exist and what they do. The \"genuine unknowns\" escape condition applies.\n23\t- **Not docs-only**: Dashboard and Notebooks are code-bearing components with\n24\t  active changes implied by HLR-1..HLR-3; only HLR-4 is documentation work.\n25\t\n26\tFull decomposition follows.\n27\t\n28\t## Strategy Structure Notes (Step 1 / Step 1.5)\n29\t\n30\tParsed: Problem Statement, High-Level Requirements (HLR-1..HLR-4), Affected\n31\tComponents (Dashboard, Notebooks), Out of Scope (empty), Open Questions (3).\n32\t\n33\t**Missing sections** (health warnings, work proceeded with available info):\n34\tImpacted Teams table, Dependencies table, Acceptance Criteria (no\n35\tGiven/When/Then with \"measured by\" clauses), Non-Functional Requirements, and\n36\tStaff Engineer Input. Owning teams were inferred from\n37\t`.context/architecture-context/architecture/rhoai-3.0/dashboard.md`\n38\t(RHOAI Dashboard) and `notebooks.md` (Workbenches).\n39\t\n40\t**Priority note**: HLR-1, HLR-2 and HLR-3 carry no priority (\"—\"); the only\n41\texplicit priority in the strategy is HLR-4 (P2). The unprioritized core HLRs\n42\twere defaulted to **P1** (core value delivery, leadership wants visible\n43\tprogress)