{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-97a1b873c792268d","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9008-E004\n3\ttitle: Reduce data-scientist onboarding time to under one day\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9008\n5\tcomponent: Notebooks\n6\tteam: Workbenches\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9008-E002\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9008-E002\n12\tgate_failure_impact:\n13\t  action: rewrite\n14\t  fallback_approach: If the onboarding definition concludes the first-day spend is\n15\t    dominated by a surface outside the workbench scope (e.g. cluster access provisioning),\n16\t    this epic's scope is rewritten to target the identified bottleneck, or split across\n17\t    the owning components; in either case the component/team assignment is re-checked\n18\t    against the surfaces the baseline actually identifies when the investigation resolves.\n19\t    If onboarding is already within target after definition, the epic is removed.\n20\tai_signals:\n21\t  change_specificity: -1\n22\t  pattern_precedent: 0\n23\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n24\t  existing_foundation: 0\n25\t  open_questions: -1\n26\t  external_dependency: 0\n27\t  human_process_gates: 0\n28\t  repo_access: 1\n29\t  architecture_claims: 0\n30\timplementation_type: null\n31\tinvestigation_signals: null\n32\tai_implementability: Low\n33\tai_implementability_score: -1\n34\tjira_key: null\n35\tbranch: null\n36\t---\n37\t# Reduce data-scientist onboarding time to under one day\n38\t\n39\t## Description\n40\t\n41\tImplements the onboarding improvements that bring a new data scientist's\n42\tfirst day under the one-day target, targeting the friction points identified\n43\tby the onboarding-scope definition and baseline work. The concrete scope of\n44\tthis epic (which stages and surfaces change) is determined by that\n45\tinvestigation's outcome; this epic cannot start until the onboarding\n46\tdefinition and baseline exist.\n47\t\n48\t## Scope\n49\t\n50\t- Reduce friction in the onboarding stages the onboarding definition\n51\t  identified as the dominant first-day cost — within the Workbenches/Notebooks\n52\t  surface (workbench spawn flow, defaults, provisioning behavior, idle\n53\t  handling) and, where the baseline points there, coordinated changes to the\n54\t  console surfaces a new data scientist traverses.\n55\t- Address the top-ranked friction points from the baseline breakdown; defer\n56\t  lower-ranked ones explicitly with rationale.\n57\t- Verify the improvement against the measured baseline, using the measurable\n58\t  onboarding target produced by the onboarding definition work.\n59\t\n60\t## Acceptance Criteria\n61\t\n62\t- Onboarding time for a new data scientist, measured across the defined\n63\t  onboarding scope and with the same measurement method as the baseline, is\n64\t  under one day.\n65\t- The top-ranked friction points from the baseline breakdown are addressed,\n66\t  or explicitly deferred with documented rationale.\n67\t- Changes preserve existing workbench lifecycle behavior for current users;\n68\t  any change to default behavior is reversible (configuration default or\n69\t  feature flag) so administrators can restore prior behavior.\n70\t\n71\t## HLR Traceability\n72\t\n73\t- HLR-2 (onboarding a new data scientist should take less than a day) — this\n74\t  epic delivers the measurable onboarding-time reduction once the scope and\n75\t  baseline are defined.\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8b23e8a884f0e9d9","agent_id":"a43c4a9c68828c81a","session_id":"75f31b44-6829-4bc6-8c24-b6fae2a504e2","uuid":"eeaf6362-77c6-486c-aea5-11dd26559a1c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:08:39.575Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-97a1b873c792268d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9008 decomposition"}
