h tool (console experience,\n50\t  authentication, workbench environment, or serving/pipeline integration as\n51\t  determined).\n52\t- Coordinate any upstream or vendor dependency the identification work\n53\t  flagged for a shortlisted integration.\n54\t- Validate each integration against the enterprise environment expectations\n55\t  defined during tooling identification.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- Each shortlisted integration is implemented on its mapped platform surface\n60\t  and demonstrably works with the corresponding enterprise tool.\n61\t- Integrations requiring upstream or vendor coordination track that\n62\t  dependency explicitly, with a stated fallback if it stalls.\n63\t- Integrations are reversible or additive: existing platform behavior for\n64\t  users who do not use the integrated tooling is unchanged.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-3 (the platform should integrate better with existing enterprise\n69\t  tooling) — this epic delivers the concrete integrations once the target\n70\t  tools are identified and prioritized.\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8b23e8a884f0e9d9","agent_id":"a43c4a9c68828c81a","session_id":"75f31b44-6829-4bc6-8c24-b6fae2a504e2","uuid":"cc573bc8-49c0-4361-b2ca-be13f30041d8","timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:08:40.479Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-acec7fc63f884bd0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9008 decomposition"}
